{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-attention-expensive","title":"为何注意力昂贵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/why-attention-expensive","wordCount":1790,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"complexity-bottleneck","title":"二次复杂度瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/complexity-bottleneck","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"efficient-attention-taxonomy","title":"高效注意力谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>要谈「高效」，先得精确地知道「低效」从何而来。这一章不急着给方法，而是把朴素自注意力的成本结构拆到能用数字说话的程度，让后面每一类优化都能对号入座地说清「它砍掉的到底是哪一笔账」。</p>\n<p>三篇文档层层递进。第一篇「为何注意力昂贵」给的是直觉与定性图景：注意力在算什么、那张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的相关性矩阵为何既吃算力又吃显存、为什么在长序列下显存常常比算力更早成为致命瓶颈，以及 prefill 与 decode 两个阶段的成本画像截然不同。第二篇「二次复杂度瓶颈」把直觉换成公式：逐项数清前向的 FLOPs 与显存、引入「算术强度」这把衡量访存瓶颈的尺子、画出复杂度随序列长度增长的曲线，解释为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是一堵真实存在的墙而非理论吓唬。第三篇「高效注意力谱系」是全 hub 的地图：把稀疏、线性、低秩核、IO 感知、近似、混合这些流派放进一张分类体系，标明每一类砍的是「计算复杂度」还是「硬件访存」，并指向 hub 里对应的主讲篇目。</p>\n<p>读完这一章，你会拥有一套统一的坐标系：任何一个新的高效注意力方法，都能被你迅速归类、判断它和已有方法是正交还是替代关系。这正是后面三章能保持清晰、不互相重复的前提。建议先读完本章再进入方法章；若只想要结论，第三篇的谱系表可作为随时回查的索引。</p>\n"}